{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/8ad796ba45e31c4581afec49d9f16846.avif?t=1766123610\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/b81ace59ecff44998a850e8ab4e85299.avif?t=1766123610\" width=1240 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the edge of the world lies a legendary land\u2014the Kingdom of Lazy Eggs.<br>Its people live a life of idleness, avoiding war, yet they excel at crafting bizarre and lewd magical contraptions. For generations, they have guarded the nation\u2019s power source\u2014the Testicle Power Core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They worship an ancient, short-tempered guardian deity: <strong>ANGRY DIK</strong>.<br>One day, a covetous group of Demon Goddesses set their eyes on the sacred Eggs, hoping to claim them as their own. Whoever seizes the Testicle Power Core will unleash endless climaxes and dominate the world\u2019s energy of desire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As his followers faced devastation, ANGRY DIK descended in fury, determined to defend his people.<br>Prepare yourself for the wrathful bombardment of the Furious Shaft!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Even in sloth, the hardest defense shall guard the nation.&quot;</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/df042e4ad65e411dafa466b5664281f5.avif?t=1766123610\" width=1240 height=240 /></span><strong> </strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/9d961dd80fa571508cbae32b2b27690e.poster.avif?t=1766123610\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/9d961dd80fa571508cbae32b2b27690e.webm?t=1766123610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/9d961dd80fa571508cbae32b2b27690e.mp4?t=1766123610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>\u201cYou\u2019ll witness it soon enough!\u201d</strong><br>Pull the Furious Shaft Cannon, adjust angle and power, and fire precise shots. Make clever use of magical devices to restrain and subdue Demon Queens, leaving them no chance to escape. Experience the thrill of tactics and skill in perfect synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>\u201cIs it breaking apart!? Indeed\u2014it\u2019s our kingdom\u2019s newest weapon!\u201d</strong><br>Activate the unique bullet system, each with special effects: the slippery \u201cEssence Shot,\u201d the fiery \u201cFlame Shot\u201d that reacts with Essence, or the humiliating \u201cPhallus Curse Shot.\u201d Each weakens the Demon Queen\u2019s \u201cShame\u201d while boosting her \u201cArousal,\u201d offering a diverse and exhilarating battle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>\u201cBow down before the latest technology of our kingdom!\u201d</strong><br>Conquer characters to unlock exquisite CG variations and enjoy complete interactive stories. After victory, multiple variations show their submission under your technological might, fulfilling your urge to dominate and control.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/e400e76b22f060f36f1d39e966e92c64.avif?t=1766123610\" width=1240 height=240 /></span><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/2c5b22a8bc53ae138bad516f1de0f5aa.avif?t=1766123610\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creative fusion of <strong>classic slingshot mechanics</strong> and <strong>adult game elements</strong>, delivering a fresh, provocative gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple richly designed characters, each with unique personalities, storylines, interactive scenes, and CG variations to satisfy a wide range of player preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse arsenal of special tools and systems, perfect for stress relief. All at an affordable price\u2014offering 4 to 6 hours of intense and satisfying fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/fe242f31b7466621e7ac5fbad58566ab.avif?t=1766123610\" width=1240 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/9771d630375e40efe75ed0a465dcdd89.avif?t=1766123610\" width=1200 height=628 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/e95ce32ebd83a62374a78a01d2ee8947.avif?t=1766123610\" width=1200 height=628 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811560/extras/4c37a2ebc72ae98ed01791e9589ac08e.avif?t=1766123610\" width=1200 height=628 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Heartfelt Success","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811560/668a4285fba81f1e9511c09c9013af2cb3444504.jpg"},{"name":"Old but Effective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811560/710a1e145e0af2309f5c2ffefc2219f4175625d0.jpg"},{"name":"Backside Showdown","pat